ltor.ca/listing/TS639292999056200000/reb10/highres/0/E4515230_40.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639292999056200000/reb10/highres/0/E4515230_41.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639292999056200000/reb10/highres/0/E4515230_42.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639292999056200000/reb10/highres/0/E4515230_43.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639292999056200000/reb10/highres/0/E4515230_44.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639292999056200000/reb10/highres/0/E4515230_45.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639292999056200000/reb10/highres/0/E4515230_46.jpg"],"remarks":"Move in, unpack, and start living. This updated 2 bed, 2 bath condo is turnkey from the day you get your keys. The kitchen is made for hosting, with upgraded cabinets, sleek countertops, a herringbone backsplash and stainless steel appliances. Fresh paint and modern LED lighting carry through every room, and both bathrooms have been refreshed with re-glazed tubs. Morning coffee belongs on the large east-facing balcony, where the sun pours in all day. At night, retreat to the primary suite with its walk-through closet and full en-suite. In-suite laundry/storage makes daily life easy, and the low condo fees cover heat, water and sewer, so your monthly costs stay simple. Just lock the door and leave for a weekend or a whole month, with no yard work waiting when you get back. Everything is close: Grey Nuns Hospital, Millwoods Towne Centre, restaurants, the rec centre, ETS Terminal and the upcoming Valley Line LRT, so errands, appointments and your daily commute are all easy. Some photos are virtually staged. (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$164,888"],["Type","Condo"],["Bedrooms","2"],["Bathrooms","2"],["Living area","779 sq ft"],["Year built","1993"],["Condo fee","$444 monthly"],["Neighbourhood","Mill Woods Town Centre"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T6L6X9"],["MLS® number","E4515230"],["Listed","November 3, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerat